@startuml overview
' cumin-works - the reference setup for the Claude Code of a Maintainer.
' This setup is a reference, not a requirement.
' Render: run scripts/render-diagrams.sh at the root of the repository.

left to right direction

node "phone" as Phone {
  rectangle "Claude app" as App
}
node "laptop" as Laptop {
  rectangle "Claude app or browser" as Browser
  rectangle "ssh" as Ssh
}
cloud "Remote Control relay" as Relay
cloud "GitHub" as GitHub
node "Host" as Host {
  rectangle "cumin user" as CuminUser {
    rectangle "cumin run and agents" as Run
  }
  rectangle "Operator user (admin)" as OperatorUser {
    rectangle "tools and cumin updates" as Tools
  }
  rectangle "Maintainer user (not admin)" as MaintainerUser {
    rectangle "Claude Code\n(remote control, cumin-maintainer plugin)" as Claude
  }
}

App --> Relay
Browser --> Relay
Claude --> Relay : outbound HTTPS only
Ssh --> OperatorUser : the Operator
Claude --> GitHub : reads, writes\nwith the Maintainer's account
Run --> GitHub : GitHub Apps

@enduml
